 "integration": {
  "summary": "Put the chiller in automatic/remote control (BI 16 reads Auto), then start/stop it with BV 1 and write the remote setpoint (AV 1). Read the leaving chilled liquid temperature, compressor run status, each system's operational code and the two system alarms.",
  "minimum_points": [
